start: mr
R1: 2ch=dc 15dc@ring ss@top
R2: 3ch=dc 2ch [dc 2ch]x15 ss@top
R3: sl@sp {2ch=dc 2dc}@same ch [{3dc ch}@sp]x15 ss@top
R4: sl@sp {ch sc}@same [[3ch sc@sp]x3 6ch sc@sp]x4 ss@top
R5: sl@sp {2ch=dc 2dc}@same [3dc@sp]x2 [{5dc 3ch 5dc}@sp [3dc@sp]x3]x3 {5dc 3ch 5dc}@sp ss@top
R6: 2ch=dc [[dc]>corner {dc 3ch dc}@corner]x4 [dc]>end ss@top
